#: ../../source/guides/localization_plan.md:12 36ede5fa948f4b188d2fdeb6d0c8766e
msgid "1. Core Architecture"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/localization_plan.md:14 34da867f8b6b474ba7df737e78e9cca3
msgid ""
"The `findfmt` internationalization architecture uses standard GNU gettext"
" runtime protocols combined with custom Hatchling build hooks and Sphinx "
"documentation tooling:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/localization_plan.md:17 bad5bb98d24246c1b1f313803d6cad66
msgid ""
"**Runtime Engine (`src/findfmt/i18n.py`)**: Wraps `gettext.translation()`"
" with hierarchical fallback order: `LANGUAGE` → `LC_ALL` → `LC_MESSAGES` "
"→ `LANG` → `C`. Provides `_()` for standard message strings and "
"`ngettext()` for pluralized counts. Supports CLI runtime overrides via "
"`--locale <locale>` and `--lang <locale>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/localization_plan.md:21 4b65d5cf2c5f49a8a022ec9123828b95
msgid ""
"**Maintenance Tooling (`tools/i18n.py`)**: Automates message extraction "
"(`extract`), catalog initialization (`init <locale>`), updates "
"(`update`), and compilation (`compile`). Enforces relative path location "
"comments (`#: src/findfmt/...`) via `_sanitize_po_locations()` to ensure "
"local build paths are never exposed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/localization_plan.md:25 6745f8945e3e48c8b0397b4fa6e07c1a
msgid ""
"**Packaging Build Hook (`tools/hatch_build.py`)**: Compiles `.po` message"
" catalogs under `src/findfmt/locale/*/LC_MESSAGES/*.po` into binary `.mo`"
" catalogs during wheel and sdist packaging."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/localization_plan.md:28 21f7de1ad1db44888dd96cdf87e33734
msgid ""
"**Documentation Localization (`docs/source/locale/`)**: Integrates with "
"Sphinx `gettext` and `sphinx-intl` to generate localized HTML sites and "
"man pages."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/localization_plan.md:30 ed101ea5adbb4276b223fa2c10b97f4c
#, python-format
msgid ""
"**Security & Quality Gates**: The pre-commit hook `check-no-absolute-"
"locale-paths` rejects any absolute path location comments in `.po` files."
" Test suites enforce 100% statement and branch coverage."
msgstr ""

